{
  "id": "appsdk-collab-control-plane-reset",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "SESE control-plane reset graph. It authorizes one explicit reset level, proves exclusivity for that level, inventories the exact retire set including duplicate pane claimants, archives with byte-equality verification, retires the selected state transactionally, rebuilds an empty baseline, and emits one audit receipt. The three levels (routes, project, host) share this pipeline; the level selects the inventory and retire set, not the topology. Declared failure terminals, each leaving the source untouched: RESET_AUTHORIZATION_REQUIRED, RESET_DAEMON_LIVE, RESET_AMBIGUOUS_PANE_CLAIMANTS (carries the candidate list), RESET_ARCHIVE_MISMATCH.",
